nodecode-unity is a rewrite of TakeshiTGAL's TakeshiTGAL/hermes-plugin-csharp-game-editor:

  https://github.com/TakeshiTGAL/hermes-plugin-csharp-game-editor
  commit 87f7217f4baae369dbf1df405418c0f7ad711336
